Method: parse all SRT chronological cue bodies, discard timecodes/indices, remove optional `(speaker N)`, lowercase Unicode; delete curly/straight apostrophes inside words, replace all remaining nonletters/nondigits with whitespace and split. Two-row unit-cost word-edit DP with **4,500-token diagonal band**. Optimum **1,427 strictly below band**; any path departing band would need ≥4,500 horizontal/vertical edits, so reported distance is global exact. Primary read across full recording through outro, secondary *whole-source parsed for metric* with **targeted independent semantic windows**, **not entire secondary independently reread**. No audio listening, reference handouts/maps, MP3 offset alignment or model-run configuration checked.

